      summary: `Full Stack Engineer with <span class="cv-exp-text">6+</span> years delivering complete product stacks — from <strong>.NET 8 REST APIs</strong> and enterprise databases to <strong>FlutterFlow/Flutter</strong> cross-platform mobile applications and <strong>Cloudflare Workers</strong> serverless edge functions. I am comfortable across every layer: backend architecture with Clean Architecture/CQRS, mobile development for iOS and Android, frontend interfaces, and cloud-edge deployment. My projects have shipped to national utility workers, insurance operations, and law enforcement command centres across Malaysia.`,
