      sigTags: ['Full Stack Engineer', '.NET Developer', 'FlutterFlow Developer', 'Cloudflare Serverless'],
      hlCells: [
        { label: 'experience', val: '6+ Years', sub: '.NET · Flutter · React · Edge' },
        { label: 'core stack', val: '.NET 8 · FlutterFlow · React', sub: 'REST API · Cloudflare · SQL Server' },
        { label: 'domains', val: 'Insurance · Utility · Defence', sub: 'Etiqa · TNB · Cloudflare Edge' }
      ],
      body: [
        `I am writing to express my strong interest in joining your team as a <strong>Full Stack Engineer</strong>. With over <strong>six years of end-to-end delivery experience</strong> spanning enterprise .NET backends, cross-platform mobile applications, and Cloudflare serverless edge deployments, I bring full-stack capability across every layer of the product.`,
        `In my current role at <em>Etiqa Insurance and Takaful Berhad</em>, I engineer production backend systems using <strong>.NET 8 Clean Architecture and CQRS</strong> — building insurance APIs, regulatory compliance batch jobs, and Oracle/SQL Server integrations. This gives me a strong foundation in the backend half of the full-stack equation.`,
        `I complement this with extensive mobile development experience. At <em>JuruQuest Consulting</em>, I performed a full project rescue for <strong>Tenaga Nasional Berhad (TNB)</strong> — rebuilding the enterprise mobile application from scratch using <strong>FlutterFlow and Flutter/Dart</strong>, while simultaneously re-architecting the <strong>.NET 6 REST API backend</strong> with JWT authentication and <strong>LDAP / SAP integration</strong>. Delivering both the mobile frontend and the API backend on a single project under pressure is precisely what full-stack means in practice.`,
        `On the solution architecture front, I designed the full-stack <strong>PDRM C4i Command and Control Centre</strong> — integrating a <strong>.NET Core API backend</strong> with Esri ArcGIS GIS, SIP/PBX telephony, XMPP unified communications, and VMware hyperconverged infrastructure for Malaysia's police command operations.`,
        `On the edge and serverless side, I deploy production workloads on <strong>Cloudflare Workers, Pages, D1, and R2</strong> — building globally distributed systems that are cost-efficient and fast at the edge, including recently for the <strong>JomZakat Kedah Zakat Portal</strong>.`,
        `I thrive in environments where I am accountable for the full product — backend, mobile, frontend, and deployment — and where the work produces real outcomes for real users.`,
        `Thank you sincerely for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing how my full-stack background aligns with your team's needs.`
      ]
    }
  },

