        { label: 'domains', val: 'Insurance · ERP · Utility', sub: 'BNM · SAP · Oracle · Etiqa' }
      ],
      body: [
        `I am writing to express my strong interest in the <strong>Back End Developer</strong> position. With over <strong>six years of enterprise backend experience</strong> across insurance, ERP, utility, and defence domains in Malaysia, I specialise in building REST APIs, database-driven systems, and complex integrations that are correct, performant, and built to last.`,
        `In my current role at <em>Etiqa Insurance and Takaful Berhad</em>, I design and build enterprise insurance backend systems using <strong>.NET 8 Clean Architecture and CQRS with MediatR</strong>. My scope includes policy lifecycle APIs, multi-system integrations with <strong>SQL Server, Oracle, MDM, and PolisyM</strong>, and a fully automated <strong>AMLA Watchlist Batch Job</strong> meeting BNM regulatory requirements. Backend systems in regulated financial environments demand the highest standard of data integrity — this is the bar I work to daily.`,
        `At <em>JuruQuest Consulting</em>, I rebuilt the entire <strong>.NET 6 REST API backend</strong> for TNB's enterprise asset management platform from scratch — applying clean API design, JWT authentication, <strong>LDAP / Active Directory</strong> integration, and <strong>SAP ERP</strong> synchronisation. I also designed an engine-level configurable multi-layer approval workflow, demonstrating that backend architecture decisions have real operational consequences.`,
        `At <em>atQuest Sdn. Bhd.</em>, I maintained and extended a mission-critical <strong>.NET Framework 4.5.1</strong> enterprise monolith serving TNB's HR/ERP platform — integrating SAP payroll systems, LDAP SSO, and workforce analytics dashboards under a structured change-request process.`,
        `I bring a database-first mindset — comfortable with schema design, query optimisation, stored procedures, and data migrations across SQL Server, Oracle, and PostgreSQL. I write APIs that are documented, versioned, and secure.`,
        `I would welcome the opportunity to bring this depth of backend engineering experience to your team.`,
        `Thank you sincerely for your time. I look forward to discussing how my background fits your engineering requirements.`
      ]
    }
  },

  /* ── 5. System Engineer ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  'system-engineer': {
    label: 'System Engineer',
    cv: {
