      summary: `Infrastructure-literate system engineer with <span class="cv-exp-text">6+</span> years spanning hyperconverged infrastructure, enterprise networking, VPN security, and production server management across Malaysia's defence, utility, and financial sectors. Architected the <strong>PDRM C4i Command Centre HCI platform</strong> on <strong>VMware ESXi</strong>, designed enterprise VPN perimeters using <strong>IPSec, OpenVPN, and Softether</strong>, and managed <strong>Active Directory RBAC</strong> for mission-critical law enforcement systems. Comfortable operating across code, infrastructure, and operations.`,
      competencies: ['VMware ESXi', 'Linux', 'Windows Server', 'nginx', 'Docker', 'GitLab CI/CD', 'OpenVPN / IPSec', 'Active Directory', 'RBAC', 'High Availability', 'Networking', 'Cloudflare'],
