      sigTags: ['System Engineer', 'Infrastructure Architect', 'VMware ESXi', 'High Availability'],
      hlCells: [
        { label: 'experience', val: '6+ Years', sub: 'Infrastructure · Systems · DevOps' },
        { label: 'core stack', val: 'VMware · Linux · Docker', sub: 'VPN · nginx · Windows Server' },
        { label: 'domains', val: 'Defence · Finance · Utility', sub: 'PDRM · TNB · Etiqa' }
      ],
      body: [
        `I am writing to express my strong interest in the <strong>System Engineer</strong> position. With over <strong>six years of hands-on experience</strong> across enterprise infrastructure, systems integration, and production environment management in some of Malaysia's most demanding sectors, I bring both technical depth and operational discipline to every system I touch.`,
        `As <strong>Solution Architect</strong> at <em>Vector Intelligence Sdn. Bhd.</em>, I designed and led the build of the <strong>PDRM C4i Command and Control Centre</strong> — a mission-critical, 24/7 law enforcement platform. I architected the full <strong>Hyperconverged Infrastructure (HCI)</strong> on <strong>VMware ESXi</strong>, designed enterprise VPN perimeters using <strong>IPSec (RadioIP), OpenVPN, and Softether VPN</strong>, and implemented <strong>Active Directory RBAC</strong> for centralised security management. High availability and fault tolerance were not optional — they were baseline requirements for a police command centre.`,
        `I integrated a <strong>Video Management System (VMS)</strong> with CCTV feeds via <strong>RTSP/MJPEG</strong>, deployed <strong>SIP/PBX telephony</strong> for emergency call routing, and managed <strong>nginx, caddy</strong>, and reverse proxy infrastructure for secure perimeter access. I produced HLD/LLD documentation, system architecture diagrams, and deployment guidelines delivered directly to PDRM stakeholders.`,
        `On the software side, I maintain strong proficiency in <strong>Linux and Windows Server</strong> administration, <strong>Docker</strong> containerisation, and <strong>GitLab CI/CD</strong> pipeline automation — allowing me to bridge the gap between application delivery and infrastructure operations effectively.`,
        `I also deploy and manage production workloads on <strong>Cloudflare Workers and Pages</strong> — globally distributed, serverless infrastructure requiring zero traditional server management — reinforcing my broader systems engineering perspective.`,
        `I am drawn to environments where systems reliability directly impacts real-world outcomes, and where the engineering standard is set high by necessity.`,
        `Thank you sincerely for your time and consideration. I look forward to discussing how my infrastructure and systems background fits your requirements.`
      ]
    }
  },

