      hlCells: [
        { label: 'experience', val: '6+ Years', sub: 'Enterprise Integration · Middleware' },
        { label: 'core stack', val: 'SAP · LDAP · Oracle', sub: 'ArcGIS · SIP/PBX · REST API' },
        { label: 'domains', val: 'Utility · Defence · Finance', sub: 'TNB · PDRM · Etiqa · MDM' }
      ],
      body: [
        `I am writing to express my strong interest in the <strong>System Integrator</strong> position. With over <strong>six years of hands-on enterprise integration experience</strong> across Malaysia's most complex sectors — insurance, national utility, and law enforcement — I bring deep practical knowledge of integrating heterogeneous enterprise systems at scale.`,
        `In my current role at <em>Etiqa Insurance and Takaful Berhad</em>, I integrate production insurance systems with <strong>SQL Server, Oracle, MDM (Master Data Management)</strong>, and <strong>PolisyM</strong> — covering policy underwriting, renewals, endorsements, and BNM-compliant AMLA watchlist screening. Managing integration across this many systems under regulatory compliance requirements demands rigour at every layer of the data flow.`,
        `At <em>JuruQuest Consulting</em> and <em>atQuest Sdn. Bhd.</em>, I was the integration engineer for multiple <strong>Tenaga Nasional Berhad (TNB)</strong> enterprise platforms — implementing <strong>LDAP / Active Directory SSO</strong> across portals, <strong>SAP HR/ERP synchronisation</strong> for payroll and asset master data, and REST API bridges connecting mobile applications to backend ERP systems. I designed the TNB TOMAS data flow connecting FlutterFlow mobile clients to .NET APIs to SAP ERP in a reliable, auditable pipeline.`,
        `At <em>Vector Intelligence</em>, I architected the full integration layer for the <strong>PDRM C4i Command Centre</strong> — integrating <strong>Esri ArcGIS</strong> for live geospatial incident mapping, <strong>SIP/PBX</strong> for emergency call routing and dispatch, <strong>XMPP / Jitsi / Openfire</strong> for real-time unified communications, and <strong>VMS/RTSP</strong> for CCTV surveillance feeds. Integrating this many protocols and systems under mission-critical uptime requirements was the defining challenge of that project.`,
        `I approach every integration engagement with a protocol-first, data-contract-first mindset — defining interface specifications, error handling strategies, and audit trails before writing a line of code.`,
        `I am drawn to the complexity that system integration brings, and I deliver integrations that hold up in production over years, not just on demo day.`,
        `Thank you sincerely for your time. I look forward to discussing how my integration experience aligns with your requirements.`
      ]
    }
  },

