      body: [
        `I am writing to express my strong interest in the <strong>Technical Consultant</strong> position. With over <strong>six years of enterprise consultancy and hands-on delivery experience</strong> across some of Malaysia's most demanding sectors — insurance, defence procurement, and national utility — I bring both the technical capability and the client-facing professionalism that defines effective technical consulting.`,
        `My most formative consulting engagement was at <em>JuruQuest Consulting Sdn. Bhd.</em>, where I was brought in to rescue a failing <strong>Tenaga Nasional Berhad (TNB) TOMAS</strong> project with a broken codebase and a non-functional mobile application. I performed full root-cause analysis, scoped and communicated the rebuild approach to the client, then led the complete re-delivery — rebuilding the <strong>FlutterFlow mobile application</strong> and <strong>.NET 6 REST API backend</strong> from scratch, including <strong>SAP and LDAP integration</strong> and a configurable multi-layer approval workflow. Entering a broken project, restoring client confidence, and shipping a functioning production system is consulting at its most real.`,
        `At <em>atQuest Sdn. Bhd.</em>, I served as the vendor-side <strong>Technical Consultant</strong> for TNB's enterprise <strong>ESS HR/ERP platform</strong> — managing structured change requests, stakeholder alignment, regression testing, and safe deployment processes across a mission-critical system serving thousands of TNB employees. I bridged the technical and client-facing dimensions of every CR cycle.`,
        `At <em>Vector Intelligence</em> for <strong>PDRM C4i</strong>, I acted as Solution Architect and client liaison — producing HLD/LLD documentation and architecture proposals, facilitating requirements workshops with PDRM stakeholders, conducting UAT, and managing the operational handover of a law enforcement command system. Consulting to government clients under procurement and compliance constraints requires the highest standard of clarity and accountability.`,
